/* ==========================================================================
 * NZK.Core.Monolith — Compiled NZK Toolkit v4
 * ========================================================================== */
/*
/*
the via statement is banned.
all unity or system references must be via fullyquallified names
a.b.c.d.e.f.g.h.i.j.k if required is prefered over  via a; q=j.k()
*/
/*
Flow:
-1 drag fbx into scene,
-2 add toolkit as a component to the root of the fbx,
-3 system detects if it has meshes and an armature, if yes it sets mode to root from mode this. and will asume this is the new generator root

-3b if it has meshes, it will add a mesh generator, then add all objects with skinnned mesh renderes to Object marked as Source Assets's child object "Meshes" (atm its HB_Sources)
-3c if it has an armature, it will duplicate the armature (all transormations and components) to Object marked as Source Assets (atm its HB_Sources) then if meshes in "Source\Meshs" replace original anchor with cloned armature delete the original armature
-3d if it has any objects with vrc fury components on it it will clone the object to Object marked as Source Assets (atm its HB_Sources) and add a proxy sync.
- all changes to the object in souce change the object in the proxy and vice versa





































*/
namespace NZK
